  "name": "argo-team-onboard",
  "description": "Onboard app teams onto Argo CD the GitOps way — generates tenant onboarding config (AppProject, Application, RBAC, Namespace, quotas, NetworkPolicies) and commits it to the GitOps repo for Argo CD to reconcile, rather than applying it to the cluster imperatively. Discovery-first: adapts to the team's existing stack (Helm, Kustomize, or plain YAML). Recommended path is a per-tenant values file rendered by an onboarding Helm chart and discovered by an ApplicationSet. Does NOT generate CI pipelines, registry config, or secrets backends. Use when users ask about onboarding teams, adding tenants, setting up new teams, bootstrapping first apps, or self-service onboarding.",
